  "solution": "**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4bb3744cda8a395214876e844107b09b0764aaffef5df41e4547dbbca9e72dfc.png] \n\n1. 8 and 5\n\n5 + __**48 ÷ 12**__ × 8 – 13 = 29\n\n⇒ 5 +__ **4 × 8**____ __– 13 = 29\n\n⇒ __**5 + 32**__ – 13 = 29\n\n⇒ __**37 **____**– 13**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 24 ≠ 29\n\n2. 12 and 13\n\n8 + __**48 ÷ 13**__ × 5 – 12 = 29\n\n⇒ 8 + __**3.69**____** × 5**__ – 12 = 29\n\n⇒ __**8 + 18.45**__ – 12 = 29\n\n⇒ __**26.45 – 12**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 14.45 ≠ 29\n\n3. 8 and 12\n\n12 + __**48 ÷ 8** __× 5 – 13 = 29\n\n⇒ 12 + __**6**____** × 5**__ – 13 = 29\n\n⇒ __**12 + 30**__ – 13 = 29\n\n⇒ __**42**____** – 13**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 29 = 29\n\n4. 13 and 8\n\n13 + __**48 ÷ 12**__ × 5 – 8 = 29\n\n⇒ 13 +__ **4 × 5**__ – 8 = 29\n\n⇒ __**13 + 20**__ – 8 = 29\n\n⇒ **__33 – 8__ **= 29\n\n⇒ 25 ≠ 29\n\nHence, '**8 and 12**' is the correct answer.",
